! CP2K input template for SCF strategy selection.
!
! The &SCF body is rewritten wholesale by
! hotspot_al.cp2k_ml_scf.scf_strategy.apply_strategy, so whatever appears
! between &SCF and &END SCF here is a placeholder: it is replaced, never
! merged. Patching line by line would leave settings nobody chose in inputs
! that are supposed to differ in exactly one way.
!
! The density-matrix printing the dataset template carries is deliberately
! absent: this template is for step counts and wall time, and printing every
! iteration would dominate both.

&GLOBAL
  PROJECT {{PROJECT}}
  RUN_TYPE ENERGY
  PRINT_LEVEL MEDIUM
&END GLOBAL
&FORCE_EVAL
  METHOD QUICKSTEP
  &DFT
    BASIS_SET_FILE_NAME BASIS_MOLOPT
    POTENTIAL_FILE_NAME POTENTIAL
    &SCF
      EPS_SCF 1.0E-6
      MAX_SCF 60
    &END SCF
    &XC
      &XC_FUNCTIONAL PBE
      &END XC_FUNCTIONAL
    &END XC
    &MGRID
      CUTOFF 320
      REL_CUTOFF 50
    &END MGRID
  &END DFT
  &SUBSYS
    &CELL
{{CELL}}
    &END CELL
    &COORD
{{COORD}}
    &END COORD
{{KIND}}
  &END SUBSYS
&END FORCE_EVAL
